2063", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75443242_324840640175396_7527976900383511140_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=knez_dRQPqMQ7kNvwHWBAo4&_nc_oc=AdoqZ5HJqMMaNeyYlImrpMgDfeh2NN36vZMgAnwajnhEW_CwpUsFOV0B8uYyPjYpP38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyjyhADh6g72onIXjQ-7UShVYkfparfoiJpMMgVX9GoLQ&oe=69C3C5E6"}, {"file_name": "04_IZONE.png", "id": "1635497246859265", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974800_1635497250192598_4885713622178140194_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gKbVRilUhNsQ7kNvwFHxr6c&_nc_oc=AdondZAp-zKxEgNtlAdfCN9LZsNhsqmOR3FGWmuWy8YCxC_fkuiYV-dBC9EAlLIbKDE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwvaBY_OlNO_MyGHUWih3Sjkns2bmOM8Wub49CgxFikiQ&oe=69C3C0CB"}, {"file_name": "06_TEMPEST.png", "id": "1555218178586201", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75334053_1555218181919534_3389336785450721409_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gBh07pM7dgkQ7kNvwECcny6&_nc_oc=Adq63Nbp2MZQNGnbnTBa_nIKbdd0rdzn_gMS61LvmyWD1vQjtM2Cz0I-6FrPNjp1AV8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwcMRx08_crQBN1L-zt1SR54IUQ4y_GmiYLwfFgbE5leg&oe=69C3F153"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "02_Landscape_OMGxLCY.png", "id": "886684883332180", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75422392_886684886665513_3928802769089218270_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AryUsMJeFRYQ7kNvwFRhDPp&_nc_oc=AdpA7shf57cLyz7t4DDCKZwXiEbyQDWhSYgVn8-C-k_AWjntDC8QMO-OUMEs_xs4KQ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz6I_mftN5MhANvyeFAzwtyushkLdpGEzgmWpRx3kI0Rg&oe=69C3E24F"}, "display_name": "VENTA X", "keywords": ["VR", "POP", "3D", "Concert", "Music"], "long_description": "VENTA X is an app that boasts the largest collection of K-POP 3D VR videos worldwide, allowing you to easily and diversely enjoy high-quality 3D VR videos of K-POP artists, including music broadcasts and concerts.\n\nFans from 60 countries around the globe are meeting K-POP artists through VENTA X's immersive 8K 3D VR content, as if they are right in front of their eyes.\n\nDiscover the latest 8K 3D VR content of K-POP artists, updated weekly!\n\n[VENTA X Original content: 8K 3D VR MUSIC CINEMA]\n\u00b7 A performance that unfolds the artist's songs with movie-like stories.\n\u00b7 VR-optimized performances and immersive CG.\n\n[VENTA X K-POP Series content: 8K 3D VR performance VOD]\n\u00b7 Experience the diverse aspects of K-POP artists, including performances and variety shows, in a three-dimensional VR content.", "short_description": "Enjoy K-POP content produced in immersive 8K 3D VR! You can watch for extended periods without experiencing motion sickness, and the content is shot from an eye-level perspective, allowing you to have an experience of making eye contact with K-POP artists. There's a plethora of content available for you to enjoy!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "00_Logo(Transparent).png", "id": "1444402182919663", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003255_1444402186252996_7014711383928885591_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yddcbd0P0EYQ7kNvwGH9F9Y&_nc_oc=AdqpMdkcu7Gl1vuGTpRKYsYTDnhukFUFvkeZDN2K8JU-Z5lskdIiRc_6k4WBIPxXA9s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxjiEvs7gbEMfW0ravgl8ejuzhjy6gz2rKGscIE7Aq3xA&oe=69C3BF1D"}, {"file_name": "03_portrait.png", "id": "1171362250588035", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031467_1171362257254701_2035722783743461690_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X24gA01io7AQ7kNvwEu7sMD&_nc_oc=AdrewSAYo0LmuZ_mKv42UYsyOr8_2b7Qx6EtoDYZ7n0F-e70H0pw-zHIh_gdUJoBlC8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzX4ZXHilWMBMW3-RNJQyDFC4Tcsq3lYMwqLiv